# The system prompt is compared byte-for-byte against the live copy in
# %APPDATA%\devmind during deploy, and it is whitespace-sensitive to the model.
# Git must store and check it out verbatim: with core.autocrlf=true and no rule
# here, its mixed CRLF/LF endings normalise on commit and come back all-CRLF,
# so a fresh checkout would never match the live file again.
prompts/system-prompt.md -text
